        "@value": "ABBR is required in all AGS4 data files and describes all abbreviations used in headings defined by the PA data type (Rule 16).\nThe AGS Format website (www.agsdataformat.com) lists the standard abbreviations.\nAdditional abbreviations, used in any heading in the file, must be defined in this group.\nABBR_LIST details the list from which the ABBR_CODE originates. For standard AGS headings this value would be AGS4 to refer to the AGS website. For user-defined abbreviations, use the organisation identifier in ABBR_LIST.",
